WEBVTT

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.170
H-Hashiba-kun?

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.720
Sorry.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.840
Hashiba-kun?

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.150
Hashiba-kun?!

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:35.440
<i>Oh, Hashiba-kun!</i>

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:39.270
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.700
<i>It looks like he's alright.</i>

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.010
<i>Hashiba-kun doesn't need to apologize...</i>

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.370
<i>He hasn't said anything about that.</i>

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.670
<i>If Hashiba-kun isn't coming...</i>

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:56.310
<i>...I won't be able to ask him about that.</i>

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:59.130
<i>Would texting about it be okay?</i>

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.630
<i>Probably not.</i>

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.590
<i>If he can't make it, he can't make it.</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.010
<i>And it's not like we had plans to meet...</i>

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:08.060
<i>Oh, I know!</i>

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:15.270
I never thought I'd collapse and fall unconscious!

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.560
It's a good thing I didn't give you my cold.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.900
Huh?

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:21.070
Unconscious?

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:24.630
Oh, true, you didn't respond when
I said your name... Were you okay?

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:28.080
Yeah, it wasn't that bad, really.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:30.030
It's just...

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:32.870
I don't remember Mattsun and Kei-chan turning up.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:38.810
Actually, everything's pretty hazy starting
around when you gave me the gloves.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:42.560
I'm pretty shocked about that, too.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.550
Then...

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:46.850
You don't remember what
you did before you collapsed?

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:49.310
Right.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:53.280
Wait, did I say something weird?

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.690
Or make an awful face?

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.440
Or... did I throw up?

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.530
No.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:02.550
On that day.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:06.700
<i>I felt sad for some reason,
and found myself tearing up.</i>

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.020
<i>I didn't understand why.</i>

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:14.930
<i>I kept thinking about it everyday.</i>

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.320
<i>I wanted to ask someone for advice.</i>

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.640
<i>But I felt like I needed to find the answer on my own.</i>

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.010
<i>Winter break ended and I still feel that way.</i>

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:10.530
Time's up. Pass your tests forward.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.700
Anna...

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.790
How was the quiz for you?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.960
I think I managed well enough.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.330
I have no idea how I did!

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.880
Surprise quizzes are so not fair!

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:24.640
I'm sure you did just fine.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:27.260
Thanks, Anna! You're so sweet!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.790
Are you going to meet with Yukirin today?

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.380
Hmm...

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:33.100
I'll go if you're going.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:34.890
Okay, then let's go.

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:42.940
Kobayakawa-san!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:46.070
Going already? I haven't seen you since New Year's.

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:46.730
Yeah.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.080
Oh, right!

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.900
Uh, we had that surprise quiz today...

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.490
So we're thinking of going
somewhere fun to let loose.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:56.280
You two want to come with?

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.040
We can't.

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:00.870
We have plans with Yukirin today.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.580
Oh... I see.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:05.220
Bye.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:08.050
Okay! See you tomorrow.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.890
Damn, she's cute...

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.690
Why are you looking at me?

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:26.480
Well, Yukirin did mention about
giving them souvenirs from Tokyo.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:30.540
Can't we...join them for that?

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.510
Why would we join them?

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:33.410
Well...

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.580
Wouldn't they be talking about girl stuff?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.200
I see...

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.690
That makes sense.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.550
<i>Maybe I was a bit cold...</i>

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:52.070
<i>But I felt kind of awkward.</i>

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:56.340
This is for Miss Kobayakawa.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:57.800
And this is for Marippe.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:59.390
And here's Nonnon's.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:01.740
Your souvenirs from Tokyo!

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.640
Enjoy!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.360
Thank you for getting these, Yukirin.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.560
Uh, thanks.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.250
What a cute mug!

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.740
Thank you so much!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.410
I hope you'll use it!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.760
Did you go to Tokyo for sightseeing?

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:19.480
Nope, for an event.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.280
I went to cosplay!

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:22.080
Cosplay?

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.330
Why would you do that stuff?

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:25.420
Well...

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:28.040
What can I say? It's my hobby!

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.040
What?!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.560
What did you cosplay as?

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.050
Wanna see?

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.970
I've got pictures.

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.140
Tah-dah!

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.980
That's some major cosplay.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:40.770
Who's that?

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:41.870
It's me.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:42.870
Is that a wig?

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:43.560
Yep!

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.550
I made the costume myself.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:46.540
Oh, I know!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:48.400
What if we all cosplay sometime?

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.650
Not me!

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:51.010
Why not?

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.350
You were such a cute waitress at the festival.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.530
Forget about it!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:07:00.020
Oh! But I'd love to see you cosplay, Anna!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.740
You're so cute, you'd look good in anything!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.090
Anna?

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:11.090
Oh, sorry. I was zoning out.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:13.170
Um... cosplay, you say?

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:14.050
Wanna see pics?

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:14.960
Here.

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:18.980
That's amazing.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:20.580
You look totally different.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.940
You can scroll to see a bunch more.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:30.280
I'm sorry. This one's different.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.580
I think it's Naoe-kun.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.070
Huh? What could that be?

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:34.610
It's a bit out of focus...

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:36.150
Oh, this one!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.990
I tried taking a smoochie of me
and Tsuyoponnu, but he got away!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.550
A “smoochie"?

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:42.580
A shot of us kissing.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.840
Did you get one?

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.590
No such luck!

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:48.000
<i>Kissing?</i>

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.120
So, the two of you kiss?

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.170
Well, we are going out and all.
We kiss as often as you'd expect.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.980
That's lovely!

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:59.840
I want to go out with Keiichi-san and kiss him!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.220
Like, "Go ahead, force your kiss on me".

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.010
Nonnon, you're drooling!

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:07.940
Oh! E-Excuse me!

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:11.100
<i>Forced kisses are good!?</i>

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.190
<i>Would that describe what happened to me?</i>

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.440
Getting a forced kiss?

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.830
That's horrible, got it?!

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:30.570
It's the absolute worst!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.600
That's "I'm suing your ass!" territory!

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.750
What? Really?

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:39.630
Mari-chan, did that happen to you?

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:40.840
Uh!

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:46.950
...No.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.770
Marippe, your reaction says yes,

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:51.060
Mari-san is so easy to read!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.110
Wait, Anna! It was just an accident!

00:08:58.460 --> 00:08:59.770
Oh, okay.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:01.940
So you've had a boyfriend.

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:04.950
He wasn't my boyfriend!
I don't need some boyfriend!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.490
He just did it without asking me.

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.380
Without asking you?

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:10.330
Did you ask him why he did it?

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.500
I don't want to know why.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.490
Why not?

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.250
Because I didn't like it. Please, Anna...

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.480
What did you do after he kissed you?

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.310
I slugged him.

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:20.530
Who was it?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:21.850
I don't want to say!

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:26.380
<i>We've all had different experiences...</i>

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:30.100
<i>Then maybe it's fine to ask them about it.</i>

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:31.670
Um...

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:35.540
Oh.

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:36.310
Wow!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:39.300
Tsuyoponnu, what are you doing here?

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.880
Kei-chan was in the mood for junk food.

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.280
We came to get hamburgers.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.610
Keiichi-san!

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.320
He's here?!

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:47.700
I am!

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:48.740
Hello!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.120
What were you girls talking about?

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.920
About how you're a pain!

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.030
What should we do? Change seats?

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.010
There's eight of us.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:59.300
Are you sure we wouldn't be in the way?

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.650
Kobayakawa-san, what a
coincidence, meeting you here.

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:02.950
Uh...

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.090
Yeah.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.790
Oh, is that the new menu item? How was it?

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:08.640
Yeah.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:10.890
I went with that, too!

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:12.270
Was it good?

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:13.790
Um... Uh...

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.560
I need to leave for work.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.680
Huh? You have work today?

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.670
I have to get to cram school, too.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:21.640
It sucks.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:22.540
Huh?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.490
Is it that late already?

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:26.390
Bye. Have fun.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.060
Please, invite me again!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.220
Sure thing! Bye bye!

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:37.750
Now then, what should I do?

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.520
Want to sit here?

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:40.350
Sounds good.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.620
Thank you for coming.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.970
Say, Anna...

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:54.960
Was it okay going this out of the way
when you have work today?

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.480
Oh, right.

00:10:57.480 --> 00:11:00.060
Um, I was zoning out again.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.780
You're acting weird...

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:06.210
Did you really have work today?

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:11.200
Today... I'm not really in the mood for fun.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.270
But you could've stayed if you wanted.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.140
I'm fine either way!

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:20.050
But if you're not happy, I can't be happy either!

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:22.460
Do I look that unhappy?
